# Fleet / Android / hosted gateway

- LAN server: `RouteFinder/Sources/RouteFinderFleetServer` + `FleetServerCore`; smoke via `Docs/fleet-e2e-qa.md`.
- Web desk: `web-dispatch/` (Bearer = `--api-key` / org token — never operator ORS key).
- Hosted: `hosted-gateway/` (Operator VPS); see `Docs/hosted-gateway-deployment.md`.
- Android C2: `android-fleet-driver/`; gate notes in `Docs/android-c2-gate.md`.
- Prefer `@Docs/fleet-e2e-qa.md` or `@Docs/fleet-setup-guide.md` over scanning the whole Docs tree.
